# PHASE 2 — DATABASE + BACKEND + PRODUCTION-LIKE WORKFLOW

You are a senior full-stack architect and backend engineer.

Phase 1 has already been completed.

The Phase 1 frontend is a polished, mobile-first Food Cart ordering and
operations application.

Phase 2 must now convert the Phase 1 prototype into a fully functional
application backed by a real database and API.

