# 4. DATABASE DESIGN PRINCIPLE
--------------------------------------------------

The database must be designed for a SaaS product where multiple Food Cart
businesses can eventually use the same platform.

Therefore every business-owned record must be scoped to a Store.

The core relationship is:

Store
 ├── Users
 ├── Categories
 ├── Products
 ├── Orders
 ├── Customers
 ├── Printers
 └── Settings

Do NOT create a database that only works for the demo Food Cart.

